sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator as Platform operator
    participant UI as Platform admin UI
    participant BFF as Platform admin route
    participant API as NestJS platform API
    participant Control as Control-plane database
    participant Provision as Provisioning workflow
    participant TenantDB as New tenant database

    Operator->>UI: Submit organization setup
    UI->>BFF: Send validated organization request
    BFF->>API: Authenticated platform mutation
    API->>Control: Create organization in provisioning state
    Control-->>API: Organization identity
    API->>Provision: Start durable provisioning run
    Provision->>TenantDB: Create database/schema and credentials
    Provision->>TenantDB: Apply migrations and seed required data
    Provision->>Control: Persist step evidence and tenant connection metadata
    Provision-->>API: Complete or actionable failure
    API-->>BFF: Provisioning status
    BFF-->>UI: Render status and retry path
    UI-->>Operator: Organization ready or blocked

    Note over Provision,TenantDB: The workflow is idempotent and must not expose credentials to the browser.